'''''Art Plus Magazine''''' (stylized as '''''Art+ Magazine''''', formerly known as '''''Contemporary Art Philippines''''') is a [[magazine]] published [[bi-monthly]] from [[Mandaluyong|Mandaluyong, Philippines]]. The magazine includes reviews of visual arts exhibitions in and around the [[Philippines]] as well as features on [[Philippine art]], book, film, and theater reviews, a visual arts calendar, an auction update section, an exhibitions calendar, and a gallery directory. It also features the White Wall section, where guest contributors and [[curator]]s select featured artwork around a theme.<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://aaa.org.hk/en/collection/search/library/art-magazine-all-holdings |title=''Art+ Magazine'' (All Holdings) |last=Archive |first=Asia Art |website=aaa.org.hk |language=en |access-date=2020-01-13}}</ref> It is the only magazine in the Philippines to specialize in Philippine visual art.<ref name="Art+ about">{{Cite web |url=http://artplus.ph/about-us/ |title=About Us |website=Art+ Magazine |language=en |access-date=2020-01-13}}</ref>

The company's multimedia platform expanded in recent years with the launch of Art+ Magazine's [[e-commerce]] arm, ''Art+ Collectibles'',<ref>{{Cite web |title=Art Plus Shop |url=https://artplus.shop/ |access-date=2022-09-16 |website=Art Plus Collectibles |language=en}}</ref> in 2021. The online shop extended into an inclusive platform for up-and-coming local artists as it opened its online exhibition space through ''Art+ Discoveries''. Recently, Art+  launched the first ''Modern and Contemporary Art Festival''<ref>{{Cite web |title=Meet the new weekend art fair in town: the Modern and Contemporary Art Festival happening this July |url=https://philstarlife.com/geeky/740939-mocaf-art-fair? |access-date=2022-09-16 |website=l!fe • The Philippine Star}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-07-25 |title=Diversity of styles, accessible subjects at MoCAF |url=https://lifestyle.inquirer.net/410916/diversity-of-styles-accessible-subjects-at-mocaf/ |access-date=2022-09-16 |website=Inquirer Lifestyle |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=admin |title=A Celebration of Philippine Art |url=https://artplus.ph/a-celebration-of-philippine-art/ |access-date=2022-09-16 |website=Art Plus Magazine |language=en-US}}</ref> (alternatively known as MoCAF), featuring the fast-developing Philippine art scene, showcasing revered modern and contemporary masters and rising artists.

